  "name": "Table of Results",
  "problem": "The following table shows the first six binomial expansions.\n\n| **Power** | **Pascal's Triangle** | **Binomial** | **Binomial Expansion** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $0$ | $\\mathbf{1}$ | $(a + b)^0$ | $\\mathbf{1}$ |\n| $1$ | $\\mathbf{1}\\quad\\mathbf{1}$ | $(a + b)^1$ | $\\mathbf{1}a + \\mathbf{1}b$ |\n| $2$ | $\\mathbf{1}\\quad\\mathbf{2}\\quad\\mathbf{1}$ | $(a + b)^2$ | $\\mathbf{1}a^2 + \\mathbf{2}ab + \\mathbf{1}b^2$ |\n| $3$ | $\\mathbf{1}\\quad\\mathbf{3}\\quad\\mathbf{3}\\quad\\mathbf{1}$ | $(a + b)^3$ | $\\mathbf{1}a^3 + \\mathbf{3}a^2b + \\mathbf{3}ab^2 + \\mathbf{1}b^3$ |\n| $4$ | $\\mathbf{1}\\quad\\mathbf{4}\\quad\\mathbf{6}\\quad\\mathbf{4}\\quad\\mathbf{1}$ | $(a + b)^4$ | $\\mathbf{1}a^4 + \\mathbf{4}a^3b + \\mathbf{6}a^2b^2 + \\mathbf{4}ab^3 + \\mathbf{1}b^4$ |\n| $5$ | $\\mathbf{1}\\quad\\!\\mathbf{5}\\quad\\!\\mathbf{10}\\!\\quad\\!\\mathbf{10}\\quad\\!\\mathbf{5}\\quad\\!\\mathbf{1}$ | $(a + b)^5$ | $\\mathbf{1}a^5 \\!+\\! \\mathbf{5}a^4b \\!+\\! \\mathbf{10}a^3b^2 \\!+\\! \\mathbf{10}a^2b^3 \\!+\\! \\mathbf{5}ab^4 \\!+\\! \\mathbf{1}b^5$ |",
